<item><title>Cape Verde security essay calls for lasting prevention and police coordination</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-security-essay-calls-for-lasting-prevention-and-029e1e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-security-essay-calls-for-lasting-prevention-and-029e1e/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>Domingos Barbosa da Silva says short-lived community policing and weak information-sharing leave the causes of crime unaddressed.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:40:17 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Praia hosts six-day Brazil-Cape Verde cinema event</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/praia-hosts-six-day-brazil-cape-verde-cinema-event-d59d99/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/praia-hosts-six-day-brazil-cape-verde-cinema-event-d59d99/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The programme pairs Cape Verdean environmental films with Brazilian street cinema and conversations encouraging students to make short videos.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:02:21 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Cape Verde plans new water and sewer connections in Praia for 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-plans-new-water-and-sewer-connections-in-praia-2dc667/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-plans-new-water-and-sewer-connections-in-praia-2dc667/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The 2027 state budget proposal allocates about 1,3 billion escudos to water and sanitation as the minister cites losses above 60% in the public network.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:35:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-plans-new-water-and-sewer-connections-in-praia-2dc667/share.jpg" length="42770" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-plans-new-water-and-sewer-connections-in-praia-2dc667/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
